  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: eb236693f9dbe47498f4dd7ccccbfbf3, type: 3}
  m_Name: Q1
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::InterviewQuestionData
  question: "S\u1EF1 kh\xE1c bi\u1EC7t gi\u1EEFa struct v\xE0 class trong C# l\xE0
    g\xEC? Khi n\xE0o n\xEAn d\xF9ng struct?"
  choices:
  - text: "Struct l\xE0 value type, class l\xE0 reference type. Struct n\xEAn d\xF9ng
      cho d\u1EEF li\u1EC7u nh\u1ECF, immutable nh\u01B0 Vector3 hay Color \u0111\u1EC3
      tr\xE1nh GC allocation."
    score: 3
    feedbackHint: "Hi\u1EC3u r\xF5 memory model, \u0111\u1EC1 c\u1EADp GC , good
      job!"
  - text: "Struct kh\xF4ng h\u1ED7 tr\u1EE3 k\u1EBF th\u1EEBa c\xF2n class th\xEC
      c\xF3. Struct ph\xF9 h\u1EE3p cho d\u1EEF li\u1EC7u \u0111\u01A1n gi\u1EA3n."
    score: 2
    feedbackHint: "\u0110\xFAng m\u1ED9t ph\u1EA7n nh\u01B0ng em ch\u01B0a \u0111\u1EC1
      c\u1EADp value/reference type..."
  - text: "Struct nh\u1EB9 h\u01A1n class n\xEAn d\xF9ng khi c\u1EA7n performance."
    score: 1
    feedbackHint: "Qu\xE1 chung chung, v\u1EABn ch\u01B0a gi\u1EA3i th\xEDch \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c
      t\u1EA1i sao."
  category: C#
